# The panel ships LF. A CRLF checkout would change every line of aegis.js and index.html on the
# next commit, and the plane deploys by pulling this repo onto a Linux VM -- shell here is not
# hypothetical. Same rule the agent repos carry.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
